Modified 2026 for LumaRetouch. Changes include private lazy construction with a
caller-supplied runtime, exact candidate-only configuration, strict checkpoint
tensor validation, explicit CPU/f32 construction, inference-only graph handling,
and no registry, training initializer or dependency imports. Graph arithmetic,
parameter names, shapes and unshuffle ordering target the pinned inference
architecture. Random initialization is never returned as a restoration model.
The network has not been imported, instantiated, loaded, tested or executed.

The pinned BasicSR recursive Git tree was read on 2026-10-25, truncated=false,
and contained no NOTICE/NOTICE.* file. Its LICENSE/README.md was also inspected.
No StyleGAN2, DFDNet, DiffJPEG, SwinIR, ECBSR, timm initializer, deformable-conv,
training, metric or third-party image code from that tree is included here.

